    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451030/extras/02191ec8b7a70f4378dfb47cd9ed32e5.avif?t=1754309014\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span>This small but engaging game will help train your brain: <strong>reaction</strong>, <strong>attention</strong>, and <strong>memory</strong>. Control the conveyor belt with <strong>switches</strong> and guide the balls to matching-colored points. Set new records by not losing a single life in multiple games in a row</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451030/extras/02191ec8b7a70f4378dfb47cd9ed32e5.avif?t=1754309014\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span>This small but engaging game will help train your brain: <strong>reaction</strong>, <strong>attention</strong>, and <strong>memory</strong>. Control the conveyor belt with <strong>switches</strong> and guide the balls to matching-colored points. Set new records by not losing a single life in multiple games in a row</p>",
    "short_description": "Conveyor is an exciting arcade game that will help make your brain much more multitasking. You will quickly learn to focus on not just one, but several objects at once. Please, support this project: we are already working on a new design, levels, and complex routes!",
